<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>
<pre>

File updated March 2006.


Name: The Cult of Reavers
Command: reaver
Creators: Shinarae and Firefox
Your level: 30
Maximum level: 30


Description:
The reavers are a dangerous, possibly insane religion that thrives on the
death, destruction, pain, and suffering of others weaker than themselves,
while at the same time insuring their own survival They roam the land,
smashing art, murdering families, and burning down villages Nothing is sacred
to a reaver except himself and his sacrifices to his dark lord


Joining requirements:
 Alignment must be evil (passed)
 Background must be evil_religious (passed)


